<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Post-Quantum Cryptography Readiness Report — {{.Org}}</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 18mm 16mm; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; color: #1a1f2b; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; }
  h1 { font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 4px; }
  h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 26px 0 8px; padding-bottom: 4px; border-bottom: 2px solid #14304f; color: #14304f; }
  .sub { color: #5b6472; font-size: 11px; }
  .cover { padding: 40px 0 10px; border-bottom: 3px solid #14304f; }
  .brand { color: #14304f; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .meta td { padding: 2px 12px 2px 0; color: #5b6472; }
  .meta td.k { font-weight: 600; color: #1a1f2b; }

  .scorewrap { display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: center; margin: 18px 0; }
  .gauge { width: 120px; height: 120px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
           color: #fff; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .risk-Low { background: #1f8a4c; } .risk-Moderate { background: #c8930a; }
  .risk-Elevated { background: #d9611c; } .risk-Critical { background: #b3261e; }
  .scoretext { font-size: 12px; }
  .scoretext b { font-size: 14px; }

  .cards { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin: 12px 0 4px; }
  .card { flex: 1; border: 1px solid #dde2ea; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 12px; }
  .card .n { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; }
  .card.broken .n { color: #b3261e; } .card.weak .n { color: #d9611c; }
  .card.ready .n { color: #1f8a4c; } .card.unknown .n { color: #5b6472; }
  .card .l { font-size: 10px; color: #5b6472; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px; }

  table.data { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 6px; }
  table.data th { background: #14304f; color: #fff; text-align: left; padding: 6px 8px; font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .4px; }
  table.data td { padding: 5px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e7ebf1; vertical-align: top; }
  table.data tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #f7f9fc; }
  .pill { display: inline-block; padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; white-space: nowrap; }
  .pill.Quantum-broken { background: #b3261e; } .pill.Quantum-weakened { background: #d9611c; }
  .pill.Quantum-ready { background: #1f8a4c; } .pill.Unknown { background: #5b6472; }
  .mono { font-family: "SF Mono", Consolas, monospace; font-size: 10px; color: #34435a; }
  .foot { margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #dde2ea; color: #8a93a3; font-size: 9px; }
  .disc { background: #f7f9fc; border: 1px solid #dde2ea; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; color: #5b6472; font-size: 9.5px; margin-top: 10px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="cover">
    <div class="brand">QuantScan · PQC Readiness</div>
    <h1>Post-Quantum Cryptography Readiness Report</h1>
    <div class="sub">Prepared for <b>{{.Org}}</b></div>
    <table class="meta" style="margin-top:10px">
      <tr><td class="k">Generated</td><td>{{.GeneratedAt}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="k">CBOM source</td><td class="mono">{{.Source}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="k">Standards</td><td>NIST IR 8547 · CNSA 2.0 · PCI DSS 4.0 · SOC 2 · ISO 27001</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="k">Assets analyzed</td><td>{{.Total}}</td></tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>Executive Summary</h2>
  <div class="scorewrap">
    <div class="gauge risk-{{.RiskLabel}}">{{.Score}}</div>
    <div class="scoretext">
      <b>Quantum-readiness score: {{.Score}}/100 — {{.RiskLabel}} risk.</b><br>
      Of {{.Total}} cryptographic assets discovered, {{.Broken}} are broken by a
      cryptographically-relevant quantum computer, {{.Weakened}} are quantum-weakened or
      deprecated, and {{.Ready}} are already quantum-resistant.
      This report maps each finding to its NIST IR 8547 migration action and CNSA 2.0 deadline.
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card broken"><div class="n">{{.Broken}}</div><div class="l">Quantum-broken</div></div>
    <div class="card weak"><div class="n">{{.Weakened}}</div><div class="l">Quantum-weakened</div></div>
    <div class="card ready"><div class="n">{{.Ready}}</div><div class="l">Quantum-ready</div></div>
    <div class="card unknown"><div class="n">{{.Unknown}}</div><div class="l">Unclassified</div></div>
  </div>

  <h2>Cryptographic Inventory & Migration Roadmap</h2>
  <table class="data">
    <thead><tr>
      <th style="width:15%">Asset</th><th style="width:9%">Family</th><th style="width:11%">Classification</th>
      <th style="width:34%">Required Action (NIST IR 8547)</th><th style="width:12%">CNSA 2.0</th><th style="width:19%">Evidence</th>
    </tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {{range .Rows}}
      <tr>
        <td>{{.Name}}{{if .Params}} <span class="mono">({{.Params}})</span>{{end}}</td>
        <td>{{.Family}}</td>
        <td><span class="pill {{.ClassName}}">{{.ClassName}}</span></td>
        <td>{{.Action}}<div class="sub" style="margin-top:3px">{{.Reason}}</div></td>
        <td>{{.Deadline}}</td>
        <td class="mono">{{if .Locations}}{{range .Locations}}{{.}}<br>{{end}}{{else}}—{{end}}</td>
      </tr>
    {{end}}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Control Framework Cross-Reference</h2>
  <table class="data">
    <thead><tr><th style="width:20%">Family</th><th style="width:40%">Mapped Controls</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {{range .Controls}}
      <tr><td>{{.Family}}</td><td class="mono">{{.Controls}}</td><td>{{.Status}}</td></tr>
    {{end}}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="disc">
    <b>Scope &amp; methodology.</b> Findings are derived from an automated Cryptography Bill of Materials
    (CycloneDX) scan. Classification is deterministic and reproducible. Quantum-readiness scoring weights
    broken assets most heavily. This artifact supports SOC 2 / HIPAA / PCI DSS evidence collection and does
    not constitute a formal attestation.
  </div>
  <div class="foot">
    QuantScan — Managed PQC Readiness · Generated {{.GeneratedAt}} · CBOM: {{.Source}}
  </div>
</body>
</html>
